stream
BT
/F1 11 Tf
56 730 Td
14 TL
(Endomembrane System) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The rough endoplasmic reticulum is studded with ribosomes and folds newly made proteins.) Tj
T*
(The smooth endoplasmic reticulum synthesises lipids and detoxifies harmful compounds.) Tj
T*
(The Golgi apparatus modifies, sorts and packages proteins before they are shipped onward.) Tj
T*
(Lysosomes contain digestive enzymes that break down worn-out organelles and debris.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
