stream
BT
/F1 11 Tf
56 730 Td
14 TL
(Meiosis) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Meiosis is a specialised division that produces four genetically distinct gametes.) Tj
T*
(Unlike mitosis, meiosis includes two consecutive divisions and one round of DNA replication.) Tj
T*
(Crossing over during prophase I exchanges segments between homologous chromosomes.) Tj
T*
(Because of crossing over and independent assortment, meiosis generates genetic variation.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
