stream
BT
/F1 11 Tf
56 730 Td
14 TL
(Transport in Tissues) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Tight junctions are defined as seals that prevent leakage between neighbouring cells.) Tj
T*
(Desmosomes fasten cells together so that tissues resist mechanical stress.) Tj
T*
(Gap junctions are channels that allow small molecules to pass directly between cells.) Tj
T*
(Because gap junctions couple cells electrically, cardiac muscle contracts as a unit.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
