14 TL
(Chapter Summary) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The membrane controls what enters and leaves the cell.) Tj
T*
(Organelles divide the cell's chemistry into separate compartments.) Tj
T*
(The cell cycle and mitosis ensure that genetic material is copied accurately.) Tj
T*
(Respiration and fermentation supply the ATP that all of these processes require.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
