(Review Questions) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Explain why active transport requires ATP but diffusion does not.) Tj
T*
(2. Compare mitosis and meiosis in terms of their products.) Tj
T*
(3. Describe the role of the Golgi apparatus in protein trafficking.) Tj
T*
(4. Explain how negative feedback maintains homeostasis.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
