(Glossary) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Anabolism: the set of reactions that build larger molecules from smaller ones.) Tj
T*
(Catabolism: the set of reactions that break larger molecules into smaller ones.) Tj
T*
(Substrate: the reactant upon which an enzyme acts.) Tj
T*
(Gradient: a difference in concentration across a distance.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
